      "id": "AC1",
      "text": "`parseCodexLimits` classifies healthy and limited `codex` rate-limit buckets, converts reached reset seconds to epoch milliseconds using the latest reached window, and returns `unknown` with `null` metrics for malformed windows."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC2",
      "text": "`readCodexLimits` spawns `app-server --listen stdio://`, validates the `id: 1` and `id: 2` protocol frames to normalize rate limits, and returns `unknown` with `null` metrics on subprocess or protocol failure."
    }
  ],
